  <dashboards>
    <dashboard name='Appendix'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CityProfitabilityDashboard/Appendix?rev=' id='Appendix' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CityProfitabilityDashboard' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-title'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#d8232a' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='4100' maxwidth='1336' minheight='4100' minwidth='1336' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6301' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98802' x='599' y='5845'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The report consists for the following tabs:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>1 – How to Read</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>2 –</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Summary City Profitability:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>overview of the city (and zone) profitability per market at Gross Profit and Fully Loaded Gross Profit level</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>3 – City View: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>(</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Zone) / City / Country level view on the Gross Profit. Unit Economics view shows KPIs at an order level. The report allows switching between ‘Reconciled’ and ‘Back-end’ views. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The Reconciled View the source data is adjusted to match the Lucanet output. For OD business, minor reconciliations with Lucanet are not possible due to delivery costs which can’t be assigned to a zone.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The Back-End View shows the back-end order level information sourced from diverse data sources (through Order-Level Profitability Table in DataHub).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>4 – WoW Operational Performance:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Analytical view providing insights on the last 5 week operational performance for the selected KPIs for the specified country/city/(zone)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>5 – City Zone Analytics:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Analytical view visually illustrating the KPIs for a selected market across all the cities. For OD business, cities can be further expanded into zones</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>6 – Trends View: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>shows the Unit Economics KPIs trending over a duration (Week over week, or Month over Month). It is possible to switch between the Back-End and Reconciled data views. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>7 – KPI Comparison: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Similar to Trends view, but allows selected KPIs to be viewed.  It is possible to switch between the Back-End and Reconciled data views. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>8 – Data Check:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Shows delta between Back-End data and Lucanet (% delta between monthly totals)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>9 – City View (Reconciled vs Back-End): </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Shows differences at KPI level between Back-End data and Lucanet in %. </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1892' id='41' type-v2='text' w='44574' x='10254' y='195'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='18'>Appendix</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d8232a' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3758' id='46' type-v2='text' w='98802' x='599' y='2087'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>City Profitability Report</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> shows Gross Profit per Order for the </run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Own Delivery</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> as well as the </run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Vendor Delivery</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> and </run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Pick-Up</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> business at city level (and at zone level for OD business) on a daily/weekly/monthly basis.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>      -</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>  OD Cities and Zones are defined by Central Logistics. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>      - </run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> VD/PU Cities are defined by the local Back End teams</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The Report is based on the Order-Level Profitability Table in DataHub, which combines data from diverse data sources to derive the Gross Profit and therefore does not fully reconcile yet with the Lucanet. Efforts are ongoing to close the gaps and narrow the differences.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='39622' id='191' type-v2='text' w='98802' x='599' y='12927'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>1. Orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Successful orders </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>2. Deliveries (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics team uses Deliveries as a unit measure for order delivery. An order can have multiple deliveries associated with it</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics database </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Delivery CPO in the Logistics report refers to cost per delivery, and thus slightly deviates from Delivery CPO in this report</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>3. Acquisition</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Number of new customers acquired </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>4. GFV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Gross Food Value </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Minor differences with Lucanet exist due to different definitions used by markets in capturing GFV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>5. GMV Total</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Total Gross Merchandise Value</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>- </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>6a. Commissionable Base (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> GFV - Vendor Funded incentives (incl. Joker discounts)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>in OD, delivery fees are typically not included in the commission base </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>6b. Commissionable Base (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>VD/PU Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> GFV + Vendor Delivery Fees - Vendor Funded incentives (incl. Joker discounts)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>for Vendor Delivery, delivery and other fees are typically included in the commission base (while they are usually not included in Own Delivery Commissionable Base calculation) to avoid vendors reducing their commission by reallocating their revenue from basket to delivery</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>7. Commission Revenue</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Commission revenue recognized per order </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>SAP Billing / Local Billing Tool</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Major differences with Lucanet especially in markets where SAP Billing-as-a-Service is not rolled out. Differences stem not only from varying definitions in calculating commission revenue, but also from different accounting treatments and guidelines followed by individual markets.For Pick-up business, Commission Revenue is net of DH pick-up incentives</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>8a. Commission Rate % (GFV Base)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Commission revenue / GFV  </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric </run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>- </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>8b. Commission Rate % (Sales Definition)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Commission revenue / Commissionable Base </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric </run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>- </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>9a. Delivery Fee Revenue (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Revenue charged for providing delivery service</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Major differences with Lucanet mainly due to varying accounting rules and inconsistent definitions across markets (e.g. inconsistent usage of Value Added Tax in delivery fee definition)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>9b. Delivery Fee Revenue (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>VD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Revenue charged by Vendor (not DH) for providing delivery service</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>This metric refers to Vendor Delivery Fees and is not included in DH Take in. It is shown for completeness as it is used to calculate Commissionable Base</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>10. Card Fee Revenue</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Net income from payment fees charged to the customer / vendor</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet data at monthly level. Allocation to (zones) and cities based on weightage of orders in the (zone)/city</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>11. Other Revenue</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Other Revenue includes items such as license fees from equipment rentals, Non Commission Revenue from restaurant partner marketing, revenue from 3rd party funded vouchers etc.</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet data at monthly level. Allocation to (zones) and cities based on weightage of orders in the (zone)/city</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>12. Total Revenue (Take-in)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Commission Revenue + Delivery Fee + Card Fee Revenue + Other Revenue</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Excludes NCR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>13. Delivery Costs (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Direct Rider costs associated with the delivery</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics Database</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>i) These costs are available per rider on a daily basis at zone level. Order level costs are not available directly due to technical challenges associated with assigning quest and scoring payments to an individual order.</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>ii) In some markets, rider payment cycles run as long as 30 days. As a result, the true nature of rider payment is only available after 30 days. Therefore, there is a possibility of historical data being affected post completion of payment cycles.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>iii) The logistics zones allocated to the orders are the starting zone of the rider shift and not the order drop-off zone. This logic is consistently followed by Central Logistics and stems from the fact that the payments are allocated per rider and not per order</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>iv) The additional costs associated with riders such as insurance, social surcharges, taxes etc. are not uniformly reflected in Rooster and/or Lucanet. Hence, these costs are currently excluded from the calculation and will be added in the next release.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>14. Contribution Margin % (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>(Total Revenue + Delivery Costs) / Total Revenue</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Calculated metric</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> - </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>15. Payment Costs</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Costs paid to the PSPs (payment service providers) for processing of online payments</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet data at monthly level. Allocation to (zones) and cities based on weightage of orders in the (zone)/city</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>16. Food Delivery Accident Costs (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Costs associated with food spillage and/or re-cooks </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet data at monthly level. Allocation to zones and cities based on weightage of orders in the zone/city</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>17. Full CM-1</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Total Revenue + Delivery Costs + Payment Costs + Food Delivery Accident Costs</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>18. Semi-Variable Delivery Costs (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Includes costs for driver equipment, dispatching, fleet management, rider recruitment among others</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet data at monthly level. Allocation to zones and cities based on weightage of orders in the zone/city</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>19. Shopper Costs (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Includes costs for shopper. Allocated only to OD local stores</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet data at monthly level. Allocation to zones and cities based on weightage of orders in the zone/city</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>20. CM-2 </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Full CM-1 + Semi-Variable Delivery Costs</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>21. Other Non-Specific Delivery Costs</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Includes costs associated with contact center, restaurant transmission system and methods among others</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Lucanet data at monthly level. Allocation to (zones) and cities based on weightage of orders in the (zone)/city</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>22. Gross Profit</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>CM-2 + Other Non-specific delivery costs</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric / Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>- </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>23. Fully Loaded GP</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Gross Profit - DH Basket Incentives</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>24. GP as % of GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Gross Profit /  (GFV + Delivery Fee Revenue)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>25. Fully Loaded GP as % of GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Fully loaded GP /  (GFV + Delivery Fee Revenue)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Incentives KPIs (to calculate Commissionable Base and Fully Loaded GP):</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>26. DH Basket Incentive</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Value of basket Incentive paid by DH.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> -</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>27. % Orders with DH Basket Incentive</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The KPI shows the % of OD orders with basket Incentive paid by DH.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> -</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>28. DH Basket Incentive % GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>DH Basket Incentive / GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>29. DH Basket Incentive % Total Revenue</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>DH Basket Incentive /Total Revenue </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>- </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>30. Vendor Funded Incentive (incl. Joker Discount)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Value of Vendor Funded Incentive (incl. Joker Discount)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> -</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>31. % Orders with Vendor Funded Incentive  (incl. Joker Discount)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The KPI shows the % of OD orders with Vendor Funded Incentive (incl. Joker Discount) .</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Back-end / DWH</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> -</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>32. Vendor Funded Incentive  % GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Vendor Funded Incentive / GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>33. Vendor Funded Incentive  % Total Revenue</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Vendor Funded  Incentive /Total Revenue </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>- </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Additional geographical KPIs (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>): </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>34. Area Size (in sq. km.) </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics zones measured in sq. km.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics database</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Zone sizes may change over time as boundaries are redefined</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>35. Vendor Density (per month) </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Number of</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>vendors with at least 1 successful OD order in a month per sq. km.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics database</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>36. Order Density </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Average daily OD orders per sq. km.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics database</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>37. Population KPIs </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>For OD business, cities and zones in the City Profitability Report are defined as per Logistics definitions of the delivery areas and zones.  Population is available per grid (800m x800m) defined in the Data Warehouse. To calculate population of a particular logistic area, mapping between the grids and logistics areas is performed.  Following 3 population KPIs are shown in the report:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>i) </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Zone Population</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>: Population of the logistics zone currently served by Delivery Hero. If a logistics zone overlaps with multiple DWH grids, then the entire DWH grid population will be allocated to the logistics zone. There is a possibility of DWH grids being assigned to multiple zones resulting in some duplications</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>ii) </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' underline='true'>City Addressable Population</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>:  Population of the logistics city currently served by Delivery Hero. Calculated as the sum of all DWH grids covering the city.  </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>iii) </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' underline='true'>City Population:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>  Population of the entire city, including areas currently not served by Delivery Hero</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Zone and City Definitions from Logistics, Population metrics from DS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>  Population KPIs will be provided by DH location service  in 2021</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='781' id='527' type-v2='text' w='98802' x='599' y='12146'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4472c4' fontsize='14'>KPIs</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='47256' id='528' type-v2='text' w='98802' x='599' y='52549'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The City view also shows Unit Economics view (KPIs at an order level). The Unit Economics view includes few additional KPIs (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>OD Business only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>):</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>38. CPD (Cost per Delivery)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Cost per Delivery. An order can have multiple deliveries</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics database</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The KPI is used for reconciliation with the Logistics CPO report </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>39. UTR (Utilization Rate)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Number of OD orders delivered per hour </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics database</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>40. Implied CPH (Cost per Hour)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Delivery Cost per Order x Utilization Rate. KPI shows an implied cost per hour paid to the rider for the delivery</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Calculated metric</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> -</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#4472c4' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>41. Delivery Time Average (Min)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Definition:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Average time in mins taken per order delivery</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Logistics database</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#a6a6a6' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Comments: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>-</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='1892' id='543' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery-Hero-Logo.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='9655' x='599' y='195'>
