                              <formatted-text>
                                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>** Denotes country-level data allocated by number of orders. City and order-level data not available</run>
                                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Orders: </run>
                                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>successful OD orders, according to Central BI defintion</run>
                                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Delivieries: </run>
                                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Logistic deliveries (one order can have X deliveries)</run>
                                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Total Revenue (Take-in): </run>
                                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Commission Revenue + Delivery Fee + Card Fee Revenue + Other Revenue</run>
                                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>DH Basket Incentives:</run>
                                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'> Incentives given to the customer paid by DH</run>
                                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Vendor Funded Incentives:  </run>
