                <zone fixed-size='95' forceUpdate='true' h='3519' id='298' type-v2='text' w='89000' x='500' y='41889'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>** Denotes country-level data allocated by number of orders. City and order-level data not available</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Total Revenue (Take-in): </run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Commission Rev. per Order  + Delivery Fee per Order + Card Fee Revenue per Order + Other Revenue per Order </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Delivery CPO:</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'> Logistic Delivery Cost / Orders </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>CPD: </run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Logistic Delivery Cost / Deliveries (Cost Per Delivery) </run>
