    <dashboard name='How to Read'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CityProfitabilityDashboard/HowtoRead?rev=' id='HowtoRead' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CityProfitabilityDashboard' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-title'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#d8232a' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='3800' maxwidth='1600' minheight='3800' minwidth='1600' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='99578' id='545' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99000' x='500' y='211'>
            <zone h='99578' id='47' type-v2='layout-basic' w='99000' x='500' y='211'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='22606' id='3' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='2289'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='14'>City level Profitability </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>This report shows profitability data at city and zone level for the OD as well as the VD &amp; PU businesses.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Tab</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> City View</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11' underline='true'>shows City/zone level gross profit data</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>. The report allows switching between ‘Reconciled’ and ‘Back-end’ views.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>In the </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>City View</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> tab, use the filters on the right to select the delivery type (OD, VD, PU), market, time level (yearly/weekly/monthly/daily) and duration to view market’s city level insights accordingly.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>The rows represent the KPIs (as per P&amp;L of OD, VD and PU businesses) whereas the columns represent the Cities.  The first column (Grand Total) shows a country level aggregated view.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Please refer to the </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Appendix tab </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>for more details on the KPI definition and source of data. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>By clicking on the </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='16'>+</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> sign adjacent to the Grand Total, you can further expand each City into Zones.  </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>The top section shows the Unit Economics view – Order level KPIs are derived by dividing absolute amounts with the orders per city/zone. Bottom section shows absolute amounts. Note that NCR data is not included in the GPO calculation, as per standard reporting.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='14'>Trends over time</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Tab </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Trends View </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>shows the </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Unit Economics KPIs trending over a duration</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> (Week over week, or Month over Month). You can choose the duration by filtering on the Date Level Selector and Report date. It is possible to switch between the Back-End and Reconciled data views. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>By clicking on the </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='16'>+</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> sign adjacent to the KPIs, you can expand the country into cities and cities into zones.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='14'>KPI Analysis</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Tab</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> KPI Comparison</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> shows the development of </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11' underline='true'>selected Unit Economics KPIs</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> trending over time (Week over week, or Month over Month). You can choose the duration by filtering on the Date Level Selector and Report date. You can choose the Market – also city and zone level selection is possible. Inter-segment comparison is possible in this view.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>By clicking on the </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='16'>+</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> sign adjacent to the KPIs, you can expand the country into cities and cities into zones. It is possible to switch between the Back-End and Reconciled data views.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='14'>Supporting Documentation</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Tab </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Data Check</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> shows country level KPI by KPI difference between back-end data (from the source) and Lucanet in absolute figures. The tab is used for performing country level sanity checks.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Please note that for Pick-up, in the Data Check tab the commission revenue is gross of pick-up incentives whereas Lucanet commission is net of pick-up incentives. Hence, for markets with relatively high Pick-up share, the commission revenue between Lucanet and the back-end source does not match. Pick-up incentives need to be deduced from back-end commission revenue to match with Lucanet commission revenue.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Tab </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>Appendix</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'> includes all KPI definitions and data sources</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2078' id='41' type-v2='text' w='53938' x='8500' y='211'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='18'>How to use the City Profitability Report?</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#d8232a' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='37289' id='446' type-v2='empty' w='99000' x='500' y='62500'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='37605' id='549' type-v2='empty' w='86500' x='500' y='24895'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='37605' id='550' type-v2='text' w='12500' x='87000' y='24895'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Legends</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontsize='10'>   Yes</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Æ      </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Live</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontsize='10'>     X</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Æ         </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Some issues</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontsize='10'>      -   </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Æ      </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Not in Scope</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='2078' id='559' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery-Hero-Logo.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='8000' x='500' y='211'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
